D surveillance zones from camera footage and identifies blind spots using computer vision and explainable AI, improving coverage detection by 20%.","Reconstructs a surveillance camera's field of view in 3D from raw images and video, then pinpoints the blind spots that coverage planning misses — pushing detection up by 20%. I built the full research stack, from structure-from-motion reconstruction to blind-spot identification, and layered in LIME explainability so the model's decisions stay transparent.",{},"src/content/projects/surveillance-blind-spot.md","09e30026bde1c878",{"html":28,"metadata":452},{"headings":453,"localImagePaths":454,"remoteImagePaths":455,"frontmatter":456,"imagePaths":459},[],[],[],{"title":441,"category":234,"date":442,"techStack":457,"description":446,"summary":447,"featured":52,"links":458},[444,445,423,234],{},[],"surveillance-blind-spot.md","task-scheduling",{"id":461,"data":463,"filePath":471,"digest":472,"rendered":473,"legacyId":482},{"title":464,"category":70,"date":465,"techStack":466,"description":469,"featured":23,"links":470},"Task Scheduling in Cloud Computing","2021-01",[20,467,468],"Topological Sort","Graph Algorithms","Topological sort-based scheduler for cloud computing workflows — correctly stages and executes dependent tasks across distributed pipelines.",{},"src/content/projects/task-scheduling.md","5a4265eac85ce66b",{"html":28,"metadata":474},{"headings":475,"localImagePaths":476,"remoteImagePaths":477,"frontmatter":478,"imagePaths":481},[],[],[],{"title":464,"category":70,"date":465,"techStack":479,"description":469,"featured":23,"links":480},[20,467,468],{},[],"task-scheduling.md"]